{"id":"1dbfbd2016bef53d","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-counting-process.md","title":"Counting Process","display":"df-counting-process — Counting Process","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-counting-process","aliases":["58-df-counting-process","Counting Process"],"display":"df-counting-process — Counting Process","depends_on":["[[58-df-stochastic-process]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-counting-process"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-counting-process</span><span>Counting Process</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-counting-process — Counting Process"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b5f77bed7dfe3f07\" href=\"?note=b5f77bed7dfe3f07\" title=\"58-df-stochastic-process\">58-df-stochastic-process</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\">\\((\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\)</span> (probability space)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\in T\">\\(0\\in T\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N:T\\to\\omega^\\Omega\">\\(N:T\\to\\omega^\\Omega\\)</span> (integer-valued stochastic process)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(\\omega)\">\\(\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\)</span> (discrete sigma-algebra on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StochProc}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{StochProc}_S\\)</span> (stochastic-process predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b5f77bed7dfe3f07\" href=\"?note=b5f77bed7dfe3f07\" title=\"58-df-stochastic-process\">58-df-stochastic-process</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CadlagPath}_S(b,T)\">\\(\\mathrm{CadlagPath}_S(b,T)\\)</span> (real-valued cadlag-path predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CountingProcess}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CountingProcess}_S\\)</span> (counting-process predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}counting\\text{-}process\\text{-}cadlag}\\vdash \\mathrm{CadlagPath}_S(b,T)\\leftrightarrow T\\subseteq\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\land b\\in\\mathbb R^T\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall u\\in T\\;\\left(t\\leq u&lt;t+\\delta\\to|b(u)-b(t)|&lt;\\varepsilon\\right)\\land\\forall t\\in T\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\exists\\ell\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall u\\in T\\;\\left(t-\\delta&lt;u&lt;t\\to|b(u)-\\ell|&lt;\\varepsilon\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}counting\\text{-}process\\text{-}cadlag}\\vdash \\mathrm{CadlagPath}_S(b,T)\\leftrightarrow T\\subseteq\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\land b\\in\\mathbb R^T\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall u\\in T\\;\\left(t\\leq u&lt;t+\\delta\\to|b(u)-b(t)|&lt;\\varepsilon\\right)\\land\\forall t\\in T\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\exists\\ell\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall u\\in T\\;\\left(t-\\delta&lt;u&lt;t\\to|b(u)-\\ell|&lt;\\varepsilon\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}counting\\text{-}process} \\vdash \\mathrm{CountingProcess}_S(N,T,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow 0\\in T\\subseteq\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\land \\mathrm{StochProc}_S(N,T,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\omega,\\mathcal P(\\omega))\\land\\mathbb P(\\{\\eta\\in\\Omega:N(0)(\\eta)=0\\land\\forall s,t\\in T\\;(s\\leq t\\to N(s)(\\eta)\\leq N(t)(\\eta))\\land\\mathrm{CadlagPath}_S(t\\mapsto N(t)(\\eta),T)\\})=1\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}counting\\text{-}process} \\vdash \\mathrm{CountingProcess}_S(N,T,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow 0\\in T\\subseteq\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\land \\mathrm{StochProc}_S(N,T,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\omega,\\mathcal P(\\omega))\\land\\mathbb P(\\{\\eta\\in\\Omega:N(0)(\\eta)=0\\land\\forall s,t\\in T\\;(s\\leq t\\to N(s)(\\eta)\\leq N(t)(\\eta))\\land\\mathrm{CadlagPath}_S(t\\mapsto N(t)(\\eta),T)\\})=1\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A counting process is an integer-valued stochastic process whose paths start at zero, are nondecreasing, and are cadlag almost surely.</li>\n<li>The Poisson law and independent-increment conditions belong to <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a29561e19141b05f\" href=\"?note=a29561e19141b05f\" title=\"58-df-poisson-process\">58-df-poisson-process</a>, avoiding a circular definition between counting and Poisson processes.</li>\n<li>The compensated-process martingale property is a theorem-level consequence, not part of this definition.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Jacobsen, Point Process Theory and Applications</li>\n<li>Andersen et al., Statistical Models Based on Counting Processes</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-stochastic-process","status":"resolved","id":"b5f77bed7dfe3f07","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-stochastic-process]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-stochastic-process","status":"resolved","id":"b5f77bed7dfe3f07","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{StochProc}_S$ (stochastic-process predicate, see [[58-df-stochastic-process]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-poisson-process","status":"resolved","id":"a29561e19141b05f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"The Poisson law and independent-increment conditions belong to [[58-df-poisson-process]], avoiding a circular definition between counting and Poisson processes.","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}","display":false},{"tex":"0\\in T","display":false},{"tex":"N:T\\to\\omega^\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P(\\omega)","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{StochProc}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CadlagPath}_S(b,T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CountingProcess}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}counting\\text{-}process\\text{-}cadlag}\\vdash \\mathrm{CadlagPath}_S(b,T)\\leftrightarrow T\\subseteq\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\land b\\in\\mathbb R^T\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\forall u\\in T\\;\\left(t\\leq u<t+\\delta\\to|b(u)-b(t)|<\\varepsilon\\right)\\land\\forall t\\in T\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\exists\\ell\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\forall u\\in T\\;\\left(t-\\delta<u<t\\to|b(u)-\\ell|<\\varepsilon\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}counting\\text{-}process} \\vdash \\mathrm{CountingProcess}_S(N,T,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow 0\\in T\\subseteq\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\land \\mathrm{StochProc}_S(N,T,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\omega,\\mathcal P(\\omega))\\land\\mathbb P(\\{\\eta\\in\\Omega:N(0)(\\eta)=0\\land\\forall s,t\\in T\\;(s\\leq t\\to N(s)(\\eta)\\leq N(t)(\\eta))\\land\\mathrm{CadlagPath}_S(t\\mapsto N(t)(\\eta),T)\\})=1","display":true}],"bytes":2266,"backlinks":[{"id":"a29561e19141b05f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":4,"excerpt":"$N:\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\to\\omega^\\Omega$ (counting process, see [[58-df-counting-process]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-375","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-counting-process.md|58-df-counting-process]]（batch15）"}],"outgoing":["b5f77bed7dfe3f07","a29561e19141b05f"]}